    "source_quote": "Ember-1 is rolling out as a serving option alongside the base Kimi K3 model as a Research Preview release on Serverless. To support the rapidly growing open-source ecosystem, we're introducing research releases to give developers two-week serverless access to new research models, making them permanent based on community demand. For agentic coding and other workloads where reasoning tokens account for most of the cost, it delivers the same quality at roughly half the token cost.",
